 <h3><u>Hussain ghaiz mein hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Hussain... Hussain<br> Aaj maidaa'n mein husain ibn e ali ghaiz mein hai<br> fatema ghaiz mein hai, haqq ke wali ghaiz mein hai<br> saath shabbir ke jitne hai sabhi ghaiz mein hai<br> aisa lagta hai sawa laakh nabi ghaiz mein hai<br> apni talwaar se baazi ye palat dega hussain<br> aaj maidaa'n ko jahannam mein ulat dega hussain<br> al hafeez o al-amaa'n..(4)</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(10)</p> 
  <p>Aaj maidaa'n mein husain ibn e ali ghaiz mein hai<br> fatema ghaiz mein hai, haqq ke wali ghaiz mein hai<br> saath shabbir ke jitne hai sabhi ghaiz mein hai<br> aisa lagta hai sawa laakh nabi ghaiz mein hai<br> apni talwaar se baazi ye palat dega hussain<br> aaj maidaa'n ko jahannam mein ulat dega hussain</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>1. Faisla kun mere maula ki ladayi hogi<br> khoon mein tarr abhi darya ki tarayi hogi<br> maut ke sarpe ghata maut ki chayi hogi<br> aise maidaan mein har saff ki safayi hogi<br> denge koofe mein khabar bhaag ke jaane wale<br> bhaago bhaago yaha'n shabbir hai aane wale</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>2. Abhi khul jayega shabbir akele kya hai<br> fatemi sher ke aage ye darinde kya hai<br> saamne qamat e tauheed ke bole kya hai<br> shaam ke soorma apne ko samajhte kya hai<br> hoga is shaan se hamla asad e talib ka<br> kalma padh padhke marenge ye abu talib ka</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>3. Hogayi jung pe aamada khuda ki qudrat<br> ghaiz ko deke jagah hatt gayi peeche rehmat<br> pyaar se baat ki lekin nahi samjhi ummat<br> chhe mahine se bohot shor tha bay'at bay'at<br> tegh kuch der mein jab ibn e ali kholega<br> koi bay'at to kuja be bhi nhi bolega</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>4. Aasteeno ko ulat-te hai hussain ibn e ali<br> murtajiz se yaha shamsheer ali ki boli<br> saath dena hai tujhe mera aye rehwar e nabi<br> aakhri jung hai ye qabl e zahoor e Mehdi(a.t.f.s)<br> aaj har munkir e maula ko jakadna hoga<br> nau(9) imamo ki taraf se mujhe ladna hoga</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>5. Murtajiz bola mujhe bhi nahi aata hai qaraar<br> sheh ki nusrat ke liye mai hu azal se tayyar<br> dekh chehre pe numaya hai ghazab ke aasaar<br> yu udata hu mai khaak apne sumo se har baar<br> shamiyo ko hai batani mujhe hadd bay'at ki<br> pao se khod raha hu mai lahad bay'at ki</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>Shamiyo..shamiyo ibn e ali behre qitaal aaya hai<br> aaj allah ki rehmat ko jalaal aaya hai<br> Allah allah re shabbir ki aamad ka jalaal<br> teghe kham hoti hai dhaale hui jaati hai nidhaal<br> asr se pehle hua jaata hai lashkar ka zawaal<br> Shimr, khooli umar e saad sabhi hai behaal<br> khauf se aata nahi hai bine kahil rann mein<br> chupte phirte hai alamdaar ke qatil rann mein</p> 
  <p>Ya zahra....</p> 
  <p>6. Kehke ya zahra jo maula ne nikali talwaar<br> darr gaye dekhke kuch log nirali talwaar<br> kuch ne choro ki tarha peeche chupali talwaar<br> boli ye shaam ke lashkar se jalaali talwaar<br> waar se apne sabhi fitne karungi tukde<br> gin na payegi qaza itne karungi tukde</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>7. Afra tafree thi wo bhagdad thi wo halchal tauba<br> khoon se aisi bani dasht mein daldal tauba<br> apne halaat pe khud karta tha maqtal tauba<br> keh raha tha malakul maut musalsal tauba<br> khud ko girte hue har baar sambhala usne<br> sar bachate hue rooho ko nikala usne</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>8. Dekh kar tegh e dosar neher se sarke zalim<br> bhaagte phirte hai sab lashkar e sharr ke zalim<br> jaye to jaye kaha'n shaah se darr ke zalim<br> ghaat ke baaqi rahe aur na ghar ke zalim<br> ghar mein bhi ghusne na ab denge inhe ghar wale<br> kaaf-te-ye se bhi badd tar hue lashkar wale</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>9. Dum nikalta tha kisi ka koi be dum dekha<br> sakht garmi mein ajab sardi ka aalam dekha<br> khoon jamte hue sharyano mein payham dekha<br> fauj mein jisko uthaye hue parcham dekha<br> qatle abbas e alamdaar ka qazi bankar<br> sheh ne wo haath qalam kardiya ghaazi bankar</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>10. Maut bhi raqs mein thi kaisa ajab tha manzar<br> ek anbaar tarai pe tha lasho'n ka udhar<br> ye sama dekhne thehri hui sab ki thi nazar<br> khauf se neher mein jo doob gaye the jakar<br> mojein kehti thi unhein maar ke thokar niklo<br> dushman e hazrat e shabbir ho baher niklo</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>11. Dekh kar sheh ka ghazab bole farishte paiham<br> hone wali hai khudai abhi darham barham<br> bole jibreel na ghabrao farishto iss dam<br> khaliq e arz o sama hai yehi khaliq ki qasam<br> kya hua aaj khudai jo mita denge hussain<br> phir se duniya nayi kun kehke bana denge hussain</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>12. Neher bhi kehti thi yeh baat yehi sehra bhi<br> khauf ke maare hue kehte rahe aada bhi<br> zinda to zinda sadaa deta tha ye murda bhi<br> tegh bhi haider e qarraar ki hai beta bhi<br> iss se bachne ki tamanna hai to lillah padh lo<br> jitne zinda ho aliyun waliyullah padh lo</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
  <p>13. Murtaza ki ye sadaa aati thi shabash hussain<br> maa(j. Zahra(s.a.) takallum bhi kahe jaati thi shabash hussain<br> jad ka paighaam hawa laati thi shabash hussain<br> zaat e wajib bhi yeh farmati thi shabash hussain<br> daad dete tere ajdaad bhi aisa ladta<br> mai badan rakhta tu bilkul tere jaisa ladta</p> 
  <p>Hussain ghaiz mein hai..(4)</p> 
